  "name": "Kessler Psychological Distress Scale-5 (K5)",
  "short_name": null,
  "language": "en",
  "description": "The Kessler Psychological Distress Scale-5 (K5) is a 5-item self-report questionnaire designed to assess psychological distress over the past four weeks. The K5 is a shortened version of the K10, and involved wording modifications for certain items to ensure cultural appropriateness and understanding for Indigenous Australians and Torres Strait Island populations. It is designed for Australian indigenous adults aged 16 years and over.",
